    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ones Above</strong> await You.<strong> They</strong>\u00a0are watching.<i> FIND THEM!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the facility. Ascend through its abandoned corridors and uncover the chilling truth behind this hidden bunker. Explore procedurally generated rooms, each holding fragments of a forgotten story\u2014items that may help you survive and secrets that whisper of a past buried in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying creatures driven to survive and Piece together the pieces of what was left by the ones before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> this facility and avoid the creatures created here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> for items which may become your only hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel</strong> what awaits in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings </strong>to explore and find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> unique rooms, each concealing its own unsettling mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter</strong> multiple unique enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your way to the top.\u00a0</strong>Will you uncover the truth? Or will THEY uncover you first?&quot;</p>",
